TLDR: The extensive simulation results reveal that the proposed scheme outperforms the benchmarks in terms of data transmission, energy efficiency and adaptivity of avoiding battery depletion, and the effectiveness of the proposed strategy is evaluated by comparing it with other dynamic benchmark algorithms.},
