TLDR: RF-Search, a victim searching system with RF device mounted on the drone to identify the unconscious victim through the spatio-temporal correlation between signals reflected from the victim and the surrounding stationary objects, and proposes a motion segmentation module and motion compensation module to suppress the signal variation caused by drone movement.},
